# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PHASE 0 (step 0.3): NEW.
# patient/billing/analytics images are now built with the repo root as build
# context (to reach proto/). Docker uploads the WHOLE context to the builder
# before building, so we exclude everything a build never needs: build output,
# Git history, IDE files, docs and local secrets. Smaller context = faster
# builds, and .env can never accidentally end up inside an image.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/target/
.git/
.idea/
**/*.iml
docs/
api-requests/
grpc-requests/
Integration-tests/
.env
**/.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar
